<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n54859" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κατα-πνίγω</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ῑ]</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>choke, smother</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γόγγρον ἐν ἅλμῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sotad.Com.
					1.21
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ ὕπνος κ. τὸ θερμόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					233
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ταῦτα κ. τὰ δένδρα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Thphr.
					<u>CP</u>
					2.18.3
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν αὔξησιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.806c
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πνεῦμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Nic.
					<u>Al.</u>
					286
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λύγγας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					962a7
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <i>to be choked up</i>, of the secretions, ib.<i><span class="en">
				967a6
			</span></i>; of a fire, opp. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐγκρύπτω</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					2
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Juv.</u>
				470a16
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταπεπνιγμένοι τόποι</span>
			<i>choked up, close</i>, opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εὐπνούστεροι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				869a35
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωναὶ καταπεπν</span>.
				<i>stifled</i> utterances, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Aud.</u>
				800a15
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.114
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. τὰς φύσας</span>
			<i>close</i> the bellows, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Resp.</u>
				474a15
			</span></i>.</div>
